WEBVTT

01:47.300 --> 01:51.940
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

01:52.060 --> 01:54.980
[Episode 13]
[This story is purely fictional]

02:12.000 --> 02:12.660
See that?

02:13.030 --> 02:14.100
There's a place down there

02:14.750 --> 02:15.820
we very much want to enter.

02:16.630 --> 02:18.980
But nothing we've tried has worked.

02:19.430 --> 02:21.450
There is, however, one kind of animal

02:22.080 --> 02:22.980
that can get inside.

02:24.080 --> 02:25.980
It's extremely difficult to catch.

02:26.400 --> 02:28.980
We went to great lengths to capture one.

02:30.000 --> 02:31.890
It's very clever.

02:32.150 --> 02:33.170
It has a fair degree of intelligence

02:34.000 --> 02:35.850
and can even be trained.

02:37.150 --> 02:38.130
What is it?

02:39.800 --> 02:41.170
You'll find out soon enough.

02:58.400 --> 02:59.220
Unit 401?

03:23.630 --> 03:25.260
If you can complete this task,

03:25.470 --> 03:27.340
I'll explain the scientific principles

03:27.360 --> 03:27.890
behind the Otherworld Tower.

03:28.470 --> 03:30.730
The secrets I know and the place I'm headed

03:30.910 --> 03:32.170
are far beyond anything in the Otherworld Tower.

05:21.120 --> 05:21.730
You know,

05:22.160 --> 05:23.050
capturing it cost

05:23.390 --> 05:25.340
the lives of over 100

05:25.360 --> 05:26.810
of our Japanese comrades.

05:28.240 --> 05:30.220
Our lighting equipment was inadequate then.

05:31.270 --> 05:32.980
We couldn't see it in the dark

05:34.560 --> 05:36.900
and had to feel our way around to catch it.

05:42.070 --> 05:43.290
Whatever you need,

05:43.870 --> 05:44.730
ask Mr. Tanaka.

05:45.390 --> 05:47.660
He'll equip you immediately.

05:48.950 --> 05:50.250
But if you fail to tame it,

05:51.630 --> 05:53.050
please don't come out again.

05:55.480 --> 05:56.810
If I manage to tame it,

05:58.000 --> 05:59.140
will you let me leave?

06:01.750 --> 06:03.610
We Japanese are true to our word.

06:05.240 --> 06:06.700
The mighty Empire of Japan

06:07.800 --> 06:09.850
has nothing to fear from a nobody like you.

06:11.270 --> 06:12.700
Tame it successfully,

06:13.120 --> 06:15.170
and I'll let you leave.

06:24.720 --> 06:25.250
Fine.

06:27.270 --> 06:28.580
I'll tame it.

06:29.630 --> 06:30.980
I look forward to your results.

06:32.750 --> 06:33.340
One more thing.

06:34.720 --> 06:35.900
Be sure to remember:

06:36.560 --> 06:38.020
when you sleep at night,

06:40.040 --> 06:42.290
stay well away from it.

07:55.390 --> 07:56.370
How much farther?

07:57.070 --> 07:58.810
About another li, I'd say.

08:01.870 --> 08:02.930
You're not playing me, are you?

08:11.160 --> 08:13.100
There's something I haven't told you.

08:15.160 --> 08:15.810
What is it?

08:17.560 --> 08:18.810
I was the Otherworld Patriarch.

08:27.870 --> 08:28.810
I was one of his followers.

08:31.870 --> 08:32.610
You've met him?

08:33.390 --> 08:33.890
No.

08:36.200 --> 08:38.580
After I was crippled, someone duped me into joining his sect.

08:39.240 --> 08:41.060
What did you do after joining?

08:41.630 --> 08:42.300
I built walls.

08:43.960 --> 08:46.940
I've seen that high wall you mentioned.

08:52.600 --> 08:54.770
How much do you know about the tower?

08:56.630 --> 08:58.010
Nothing, really.

08:58.720 --> 08:59.980
I left after only a couple of days.

09:01.960 --> 09:03.220
I'd realized

09:03.790 --> 09:05.980
something terrible must have happened inside.

09:07.790 --> 09:10.490
That was why they were walling off the entire tower.

09:10.960 --> 09:11.460
Of course,

09:12.480 --> 09:13.850
that's also how I learned

09:14.120 --> 09:16.130
there was an underground river beneath the Otherworld Tower.

09:16.960 --> 09:19.060
So you left before you learned anything

09:19.200 --> 09:19.850
about the sect?

09:19.910 --> 09:20.940
Why would I stay?

09:22.030 --> 09:22.820
Besides,

09:23.510 --> 09:25.530
if the Otherworld Patriarch were truly that powerful,

09:26.000 --> 09:26.820
he should have foreseen

09:26.840 --> 09:27.890
something would happen in the tower.

09:28.510 --> 09:29.820
He wouldn't have needed us to build walls

09:29.840 --> 09:30.650
and seal the tower off.

09:32.510 --> 09:34.940
Nothing gets past you, Third Master. Impressive.

09:37.960 --> 09:39.220
My legs may be crippled,

09:39.910 --> 09:40.850
but my mind isn't.

09:43.270 --> 09:43.700
Let's go.

10:04.390 --> 10:04.980
Wait.

10:21.870 --> 10:23.340
The leaves on this side have more dew on them.

10:25.030 --> 10:25.580
The air is damper.

10:26.960 --> 10:27.460
Go this way.

10:40.320 --> 10:40.730
Stop.

10:52.390 --> 10:53.180
Light it

10:55.390 --> 10:56.220
and watch where the smoke goes.

11:25.320 --> 11:25.700
There.

11:46.750 --> 11:47.650
I hear water.

11:48.670 --> 11:49.460
The current is swift.

11:50.320 --> 11:51.250
It must be an underground river.

11:54.150 --> 11:55.530
Then it should be the one

11:55.550 --> 11:56.420
beneath the Otherworld Tower.

11:57.870 --> 11:59.530
But I couldn't say whether the Japanese

11:59.550 --> 12:00.700
passed through here.

12:02.790 --> 12:04.290
The earth is loose and the rocks unstable.

12:04.670 --> 12:05.610
If we blast through,

12:06.510 --> 12:07.580
it could easily collapse.

12:09.910 --> 12:11.460
You brought me here for a reason, Third Master.

12:12.600 --> 12:13.860
You must have a way.

12:18.670 --> 12:19.460
Down there,

12:20.270 --> 12:21.300
the current isn't the only danger.

12:21.960 --> 12:23.010
There are hidden rocks everywhere.

12:23.440 --> 12:24.850
I've been reading the terrain all along

12:25.120 --> 12:27.370
and found that the underground river

12:27.670 --> 12:29.850
has a raised ridge here, like a dragon's spine.

12:30.360 --> 12:31.770
That means

12:32.390 --> 12:35.180
there must be a natural stone dam below.

12:35.870 --> 12:37.180
You haven't even gone down there,

12:38.150 --> 12:40.250
yet you already know what lies in the river.

12:40.670 --> 12:41.940
You truly are an old hand.

12:43.080 --> 12:44.220
Isn't it obvious?

12:45.000 --> 12:46.650
Look at the terrain.

12:46.960 --> 12:49.180
A descending ridge crosses a watercourse here.

12:49.550 --> 12:51.610
Where they cross, there must be a stone dam.

12:52.510 --> 12:55.220
Anything carried down from the upper reaches

12:56.000 --> 12:58.460
will get stuck at that very spot.

13:01.440 --> 13:02.610
This magnetic snare

13:02.750 --> 13:04.890
is an old gold prospector's device.

13:05.270 --> 13:08.100
Lower it through this crack.

13:08.790 --> 13:10.850
If the Japanese dropped

13:10.960 --> 13:12.700
anything made of iron upstream,

13:12.960 --> 13:14.180
the magnet will draw it up.

13:14.870 --> 13:17.420
Of course, whether this works

13:17.440 --> 13:19.420
depends on your skill and luck, Master Zhang.

13:20.150 --> 13:22.370
This is your specialty, Third Master.

13:22.750 --> 13:24.460
I wouldn't presume to show off before you.

13:25.790 --> 13:26.370
No.

13:27.480 --> 13:28.530
My gout has been acting up.

13:29.080 --> 13:30.060
My wrist hurts badly.

13:31.390 --> 13:32.010
You do it.

14:41.840 --> 14:42.610
Master Zhang,

14:43.030 --> 14:45.820
you've clearly never seen how a starving beggar

14:45.840 --> 14:48.180
picks grains of rice from a pavement crack.

14:48.960 --> 14:52.300
Brute force won't work.

14:52.840 --> 14:56.220
You have to do it like this.

14:58.600 --> 15:00.580
Brace your little finger against the edge.

15:00.930 --> 15:02.850
Keep your index and middle fingers three hao apart.

15:02.870 --> 15:04.610
Feel the speed of the current.

15:04.630 --> 15:05.580
Wait for the right moment,

15:05.750 --> 15:07.250
then flick your wrist

15:08.270 --> 15:09.250
like this.

15:11.080 --> 15:12.250
Too hard,

15:12.270 --> 15:13.420
and you crush the grain.

15:13.790 --> 15:15.010
Too light,

15:16.030 --> 15:17.420
and you come up empty-handed.

15:18.600 --> 15:20.270
Back when I lived on the streets of Changsha,

15:20.270 --> 15:22.010
this very trick

15:22.440 --> 15:24.490
kept me alive in the gutters for three years.

15:25.270 --> 15:26.060
But no matter.

15:28.480 --> 15:29.180
We've got

15:30.440 --> 15:31.060
plenty of time

15:31.960 --> 15:32.580
and magnets.

15:34.750 --> 15:35.300
Keep practicing.

15:43.830 --> 15:45.650
It may be a beggar's trick,

15:46.120 --> 15:47.770
but it can save your life when it counts.

16:35.320 --> 16:36.610
A Far East Conquest Medal.

16:38.000 --> 16:40.650
The Japanese did use this route.

16:44.000 --> 16:45.100
In that case,

16:45.790 --> 16:47.770
my men will find out

16:48.670 --> 16:50.530
where this river leads.

16:52.260 --> 16:57.860
[Baihua Benevolence Hall]

17:18.200 --> 17:19.220
You're here.

17:20.200 --> 17:23.180
Why didn't you let me know you were back?

17:27.960 --> 17:32.490
I hear the Mystic Nine even held a meeting.

17:33.750 --> 17:35.220
How did it go?

17:35.550 --> 17:37.770
Have you been working for the Japanese all along?

17:40.030 --> 17:42.050
You underestimate me.

17:43.550 --> 17:47.660
I've always looked out only for myself.

17:49.270 --> 17:51.660
Did you leave marks down there?

18:15.440 --> 18:18.330
Impressive, Miss Huo.

18:22.550 --> 18:25.010
You actually found it.

18:25.240 --> 18:27.330
Now I won't have to go down myself.

18:27.510 --> 18:29.570
So this really is what you wanted.

18:30.880 --> 18:31.940
What exactly is it?

18:32.680 --> 18:34.460
You brought it out yourself,

18:34.460 --> 18:36.290
yet you don't know what it is?

18:46.550 --> 18:47.250
Sand?

18:50.480 --> 18:51.220
I don't know.

18:52.240 --> 18:54.140
Did you see

18:54.830 --> 18:57.140
magic inside the Otherworld Tower?

18:59.720 --> 19:00.730
This

19:02.000 --> 19:05.180
is the secret behind it.

19:05.750 --> 19:06.810
With this,

19:07.310 --> 19:11.220
I have nothing to fear from Zhang Qishan.

19:14.550 --> 19:15.810
It's time you kept

19:17.270 --> 19:18.220
your promise.

19:22.550 --> 19:23.490
These

19:23.830 --> 19:25.490
are the Huo Clan's IOUs.

19:26.720 --> 19:30.460
[Debt Acknowledgment]
Your clan's debt to me is wiped clean.

19:34.580 --> 19:38.460
But while the financial debt is settled,

19:39.270 --> 19:40.700
you and I have now

19:40.790 --> 19:43.460
incurred another debt by colluding with the Japanese.

19:47.030 --> 19:50.180
It may seem you can part ways with me,

19:50.370 --> 19:54.860
but in truth, we're bound more tightly than ever.

19:58.830 --> 20:00.530
The Huo Clan isn't afraid to take you down with us.

20:01.510 --> 20:02.940
It needn't come to that.

20:03.240 --> 20:07.900
Working with the Japanese doesn't always end badly.

20:08.240 --> 20:09.050
Don't worry.

20:09.160 --> 20:11.660
I guarantee that if you do your utmost,

20:12.310 --> 20:14.250
the Huo Clan will survive.

20:14.880 --> 20:15.660
Of course,

20:16.350 --> 20:18.050
only the Huo Clan will.

20:19.350 --> 20:20.530
What are you going to do to the Mystic Nine?

20:24.680 --> 20:25.380
Master Qiansui.

20:27.960 --> 20:28.940
No need to leave.

20:29.160 --> 20:31.570
Xiangu and I are in the same boat.

20:31.720 --> 20:33.810
She's already in too deep.

20:35.160 --> 20:36.460
Isn't that right, Xiangu?

20:38.510 --> 20:39.090
Master Qiansui,

20:39.440 --> 20:41.330
our men have caught up with Qi Tiezui.

20:41.550 --> 20:42.250
We can strike at any time.

20:42.590 --> 20:45.180
Then kill him.

20:45.590 --> 20:46.980
Don't hesitate.

20:47.400 --> 20:47.900
Yes.

20:52.070 --> 20:52.730
Ding Qiansui...

20:52.790 --> 20:54.620
There's no need to be so surprised.

20:55.200 --> 20:57.220
Tiezui is only the first.

20:58.310 --> 21:00.700
The second will follow soon.

21:01.000 --> 21:02.180
Then the third.

21:04.110 --> 21:04.860
Xiangu,

21:06.200 --> 21:07.810
if you tell anyone,

21:08.160 --> 21:10.770
what you and I have done will come to light.

21:11.000 --> 21:12.490
You'll have no place

21:12.590 --> 21:16.250
in the Mystic Nine or in Changsha.

21:16.920 --> 21:19.220
How about this?

21:20.920 --> 21:23.460
Let's devise a grand plan today.

21:25.310 --> 21:26.460
Once Tiezui is dead,

21:27.750 --> 21:29.860
Zhang Qishan will be furious.

21:33.400 --> 21:35.660
You and I will both be in danger.

21:36.550 --> 21:37.980
But don't worry.

21:38.400 --> 21:42.900
I always keep something in reserve.

21:43.310 --> 21:45.460
I learned that in the palace.

21:47.750 --> 21:49.900
With this treasure

21:49.920 --> 21:51.140
you brought me,

21:51.550 --> 21:53.420
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama and I

21:55.350 --> 21:58.530
will be Zhang Qishan's undoing.

22:01.700 --> 22:04.480
[Ding Qiansui's personal information]

22:04.480 --> 22:04.980
Master Zhang,

22:05.510 --> 22:07.660
Xiaojin has uncovered Ding Qiansui's entire background.

22:08.160 --> 22:08.980
He is no ordinary man.

22:09.790 --> 22:10.730
He has changed his citizenship.

22:11.000 --> 22:11.900
Legally speaking,

22:12.310 --> 22:13.530
he's now an American.

22:15.480 --> 22:16.250
Tell me everything.

22:16.720 --> 22:17.380
Ding Qiansui,

22:17.640 --> 22:19.010
formerly Ding Shichang, was a native of Changsha.

22:19.590 --> 22:20.860
He became a eunuch at the palace at eight,

22:21.240 --> 22:22.220
serving in the Imperial Kitchen.

22:23.110 --> 22:24.090
During the Guangxu reign,

22:24.160 --> 22:25.490
there was a Belgian missionary in the palace

22:25.680 --> 22:26.730
named Joseph Vanderburg.

22:27.510 --> 22:28.700
He supplied Empress Dowager Cixi

22:28.880 --> 22:29.980
with Western pastries.

22:30.830 --> 22:31.420
Ding Qiansui

22:31.440 --> 22:32.860
went to great lengths to ingratiate himself with him.

22:33.110 --> 22:34.050
Through that connection,

22:34.400 --> 22:35.660
he secured work procuring supplies outside the palace.

22:35.880 --> 22:36.730
At 13,

22:37.200 --> 22:37.860
Ding Qiansui

22:38.030 --> 22:39.770
followed Joseph Vanderburg to Shanghai.

22:40.310 --> 22:41.730
He first sought the protection of the Belgians

22:42.110 --> 22:43.180
at a church in the French Concession.

22:43.830 --> 22:46.050
Soon afterward, he made contact with the Southern Presbyterian Church

22:46.720 --> 22:48.140
and wormed his way into a post at Guangci Hospital.

22:48.400 --> 22:49.140
That same year,

22:49.720 --> 22:51.850
he was baptized, took the Christian name Samuel Ding,

22:52.480 --> 22:54.050
and formally began studying theology.

22:55.760 --> 22:57.170
Then, under a special provision for church members,

22:57.440 --> 22:58.570
he applied for special registration

22:58.960 --> 23:01.140
and formally became a US citizen at 16.

23:01.960 --> 23:03.380
When he returned to the palace with that status,

23:03.590 --> 23:04.490
he became even more influential.

23:05.110 --> 23:07.010
Everyone had to show him respect.

23:11.750 --> 23:13.090
A palace eunuch

23:14.350 --> 23:15.220
transformed himself

23:16.350 --> 23:17.570
into an American citizen.

23:19.830 --> 23:21.420
No ordinary man could have pulled that off.

23:23.110 --> 23:24.220
When the Qing dynasty fell,

23:24.750 --> 23:26.180
he immediately fled with palace silver

23:26.240 --> 23:27.010
and turned to the Americans.

23:27.200 --> 23:28.140
At 42,

23:28.240 --> 23:29.380
the Americans arranged for him

23:29.640 --> 23:30.460
to come to Changsha.

23:31.070 --> 23:32.980
On the surface, he ran a foreign trading firm,

23:33.720 --> 23:34.460
but in secret,

23:35.110 --> 23:37.010
he laundered money for the Americans.

23:38.510 --> 23:39.730
But the Americans didn't trust him either.

23:40.920 --> 23:42.570
They kept him away from important business.

23:43.110 --> 23:44.700
Unable to profit from it,

23:45.880 --> 23:46.330
he had no choice

23:47.480 --> 23:48.810
but to secretly court the Japanese.

23:53.960 --> 23:55.420
The Stars and Stripes in one hand,

23:56.750 --> 23:57.900
the Japanese flag in the other.

23:58.830 --> 23:59.660
If we move against him,

24:00.640 --> 24:02.860
we may provoke both consulates.

24:03.750 --> 24:04.290
Master Zhang,

24:04.830 --> 24:05.660
there's one more thing.

24:06.720 --> 24:07.770
He's no longer at Taihe House.

24:08.640 --> 24:09.530
Once we left the Otherworld Tower,

24:09.720 --> 24:11.380
he moved into Baihua Benevolence Hall.

24:12.720 --> 24:13.220
Since then,

24:14.680 --> 24:15.770
he hasn't shown his face.

24:16.420 --> 24:20.260
[Ding Shichang, Application for U.S. Citizenship]

24:23.590 --> 24:25.330
Ding Qiansui must have realized

24:25.830 --> 24:27.730
we'd uncovered his ties to the Japanese,

24:28.400 --> 24:29.570
so he went into hiding.

24:30.640 --> 24:31.860
To get to him now,

24:31.880 --> 24:33.220
we'd have to storm the consulate.

24:33.750 --> 24:34.810
Once it causes an uproar,

24:35.240 --> 24:36.810
the American Consulate

24:37.200 --> 24:38.460
will undoubtedly intervene.

24:39.030 --> 24:39.980
Then this matter

24:40.640 --> 24:42.250
will become a diplomatic incident.

24:43.590 --> 24:45.010
That's why I came to you.

24:47.790 --> 24:48.730
You came to me

24:49.310 --> 24:50.420
not for my wits,

24:51.350 --> 24:53.090
but because you're desperate to save Wu Laogou, right?

24:55.680 --> 24:58.250
Has your opinion of Wu Laogou changed?

25:04.510 --> 25:05.770
Why don't you tell me first

25:06.310 --> 25:07.980
what kind of man

25:08.480 --> 25:09.460
you think he is now?

25:09.830 --> 25:11.570
How has your view of him changed?

25:14.640 --> 25:15.770
I want to live.

25:16.720 --> 25:18.010
I want food on the table

25:18.200 --> 25:19.420
and the chance to live with dignity.

25:20.830 --> 25:21.860
I'll trust you one more time.

25:23.160 --> 25:24.340
You'd better catch it.

25:25.270 --> 25:27.290
I believe there's a one-in-ten chance you'll protect the Mystic Nine.

25:27.880 --> 25:29.090
I'll bet on that chance.

25:31.960 --> 25:32.730
I'll help you.

25:34.070 --> 25:34.810
He's brave and resourceful,

25:35.750 --> 25:36.810
with a pure heart,

25:40.510 --> 25:42.900
though he's not well-educated.

25:45.480 --> 25:47.010
Given your usual temperament,

25:48.000 --> 25:49.380
you'd never be so reckless

25:49.680 --> 25:51.420
as to move against Ding Qiansui like this.

25:51.830 --> 25:53.250
You've come to agree with me.

25:54.160 --> 25:55.570
Laogou is vital to the Mystic Nine.

25:58.590 --> 25:59.660
He is indeed.

26:03.400 --> 26:04.090
So,

26:06.480 --> 26:07.530
difficult as this may be,

26:08.270 --> 26:09.420
it isn't impossible.

26:10.880 --> 26:12.660
First, we need to make them think

26:12.720 --> 26:14.220
Ding Qiansui is a spent pawn,

26:14.720 --> 26:17.810
but one that still has some use.

26:18.350 --> 26:19.810
Ninth Master, what should we do?

26:21.480 --> 26:23.770
Thirty years ago, smallpox ravaged Beiping.

26:24.200 --> 26:25.460
Bodies lay piled at the ends of alleys,

26:25.510 --> 26:26.700
uncollected for days.

26:27.750 --> 26:29.730
Though cowpox inoculation is now available,

26:30.200 --> 26:31.010
the disease hasn't been eradicated.

26:32.070 --> 26:33.330
Once the disease breaks out,

26:33.480 --> 26:34.090
everyone will panic.

26:35.510 --> 26:36.940
The church won't keep him there.

26:37.200 --> 26:39.900
They'll send him to a hospital at once.

26:40.960 --> 26:41.900
As far as I know,

26:42.590 --> 26:44.660
the church has its own hospital in Changsha.

26:45.070 --> 26:45.620
Yes,

26:46.480 --> 26:47.490
but more than one.

26:48.680 --> 26:50.330
St. Marie Hospital

26:50.440 --> 26:51.180
is run by foreigners.

26:51.830 --> 26:53.330
Puji Hospital, on the other hand,

26:53.960 --> 26:55.770
is nominally affiliated with the church,

26:56.000 --> 26:57.570
but is actually run by the local authorities.

26:58.200 --> 27:00.380
As long as Ding Qiansui is sent to Puji,

27:01.000 --> 27:02.570
once he's beyond the church's protection,

27:04.400 --> 27:05.900
he'll be in our hands.

27:09.160 --> 27:11.700
Giving Ding Qiansui real smallpox won't be easy,

27:13.070 --> 27:13.700
but...

27:27.830 --> 27:31.620
What has Zhang Qishan been up to?

27:32.160 --> 27:33.420
He's sent several groups of men

27:33.440 --> 27:34.290
to scout your residence.

27:34.720 --> 27:36.700
I hear he even checked your household registration.

27:39.720 --> 27:41.940
He must have been shocked

27:42.640 --> 27:44.180
to learn I'm an American citizen.

27:45.030 --> 27:47.380
Now, even if he wants to move against me,

27:48.070 --> 27:49.730
there's nothing he can do.

27:51.920 --> 27:57.220
I'd love to see that defeated look on his face.

27:59.960 --> 28:00.920
The paper is coated

28:00.920 --> 28:02.570
- with musk and aconite ointment.
- Putting up a blessing!

28:03.030 --> 28:04.420
It smells like rice paste.

28:04.420 --> 28:05.350
- A blessing! - Go away!

28:05.350 --> 28:06.540
- Once it touches the skin... - Go away!

28:06.540 --> 28:08.330
- The medicine will slowly seep in.
- Whose child is this?

28:09.240 --> 28:11.140
- Within three to five days...
- Go!

28:11.680 --> 28:12.740
- Blisters and swelling will appear...
- I'm sorry.

28:13.080 --> 28:14.530
Looking almost identical to smallpox.

28:14.550 --> 28:16.460
You let just anyone come near me?

28:18.400 --> 28:20.050
Had that been one of Zhang Qishan's men,

28:20.790 --> 28:22.620
wouldn't I already be dead?

28:23.480 --> 28:24.940
Keep your eyes open,

28:25.510 --> 28:26.420
you useless servant.

28:27.240 --> 28:27.980
Yes, Master.

28:29.310 --> 28:30.330
Day one.

28:31.720 --> 28:34.290
Next, Master Zhang, you need only send men

28:34.480 --> 28:36.220
to spread a rumor near the church

28:37.000 --> 28:39.900
that someone has returned from a smallpox-stricken area.

28:40.350 --> 28:41.250
Within days,

28:41.590 --> 28:43.490
panic will sweep through Changsha.

28:43.830 --> 28:45.940
By then, whether Ding Qiansui is truly infected

28:46.200 --> 28:47.220
will no longer matter.

28:47.510 --> 28:48.770
The Americans certainly won't let him

28:48.830 --> 28:49.900
remain in the church.

28:50.110 --> 28:50.660
Exactly.

28:51.070 --> 28:52.490
But there is still one problem:

28:53.070 --> 28:54.420
how do we get them to sign

28:54.880 --> 28:57.140
and send Ding Qiansui to Puji Hospital?

28:57.160 --> 28:59.330
I'll take care of that.

29:21.510 --> 29:22.090
That's...

29:22.920 --> 29:23.570
smallpox!

29:24.270 --> 29:25.250
It's smallpox!

29:25.440 --> 29:26.460
This man has smallpox!

29:26.750 --> 29:27.620
Everyone, run!

29:27.750 --> 29:28.290
Run!

29:28.640 --> 29:29.460
Run!

29:29.920 --> 29:30.940
Get out of here!

29:35.070 --> 29:36.090
I'm telling you,

29:36.550 --> 29:38.140
I'm an American!

29:38.830 --> 29:40.220
Who says I have smallpox?

29:40.510 --> 29:41.700
You set me up!

29:43.270 --> 29:44.140
Who are you?

29:44.140 --> 29:45.100
[Triage Form]

29:45.960 --> 29:46.460
Take him away.

29:48.790 --> 29:50.220
Let go of me!

30:19.480 --> 30:20.700
Zhang Qishan,

30:22.200 --> 30:23.900
you've set up a private prison

30:24.480 --> 30:26.660
and detained an American citizen.

30:28.310 --> 30:30.050
That's a capital offense!

30:32.030 --> 30:33.140
Let me out!

30:34.960 --> 30:36.770
Let me out!

30:38.720 --> 30:40.180
Shout as loudly as you like.

30:41.790 --> 30:43.050
No one will ever know you're here.

30:48.720 --> 30:50.380
What is your connection to Yoshiyuki Hatoyama?

30:50.640 --> 30:52.140
What is he doing in the Otherworld Tower?

30:52.240 --> 30:53.250
Why did he capture Wu Laogou?

30:53.350 --> 30:54.770
Where are they now? Speak!

31:00.640 --> 31:01.900
Zhang Qishan,

31:03.240 --> 31:05.700
don't think you can frighten me.

31:06.680 --> 31:11.180
I've seen every filthy trick the palace had to offer.

31:11.510 --> 31:12.940
I'm an old man.

31:14.200 --> 31:15.530
I can't withstand much.

31:15.880 --> 31:17.460
If I die,

31:18.350 --> 31:20.980
the Americans will come after you.

31:31.920 --> 31:34.900
Back home, we have a special torture technique.

31:36.000 --> 31:36.940
With it, I can crush

31:38.240 --> 31:39.490
your skull with one hand.

31:45.200 --> 31:46.940
Once the skull begins to crack,

31:49.030 --> 31:51.250
no matter how strong your will,

31:53.440 --> 31:55.180
you won't be able to endure the pain.

31:57.680 --> 31:58.980
From this moment on,

32:00.160 --> 32:01.770
you'll feel as though your skull

32:03.000 --> 32:04.900
is clamped in a giant iron vise.

32:05.590 --> 32:06.570
Your head

32:07.110 --> 32:09.530
will feel like a balloon being pumped full,

32:10.240 --> 32:12.860
swelling from the inside out.

32:14.790 --> 32:15.860
Then

32:16.510 --> 32:17.660
you'll hear

32:18.880 --> 32:21.050
a series of popping sounds.

32:22.720 --> 32:24.330
Those are your blood vessels

32:24.400 --> 32:26.180
bursting one by one.

32:45.790 --> 32:49.420
Zhang... Zhang Qishan, you're insane!

32:50.920 --> 32:53.420
You think I'm afraid?

32:59.270 --> 33:00.860
I'll talk!

33:01.830 --> 33:04.420
I'll tell you everything!

33:16.480 --> 33:17.380
I never

33:18.550 --> 33:21.010
wanted dealings with the Japanese.

33:21.720 --> 33:24.570
Back then, they claimed to support the Qing,

33:25.200 --> 33:27.980
waving the banner of loyalty to the emperor.

33:28.550 --> 33:29.420
And what happened?

33:29.880 --> 33:33.250
They forced the court to cede land and pay indemnities.

33:33.750 --> 33:36.090
Such treacherous people...

33:36.680 --> 33:40.660
How could I ever trust them?

33:41.550 --> 33:43.250
How did you make contact?

33:43.640 --> 33:44.490
Tottori,

33:46.880 --> 33:48.570
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama's superior.

33:49.070 --> 33:50.700
Torii Totori

33:51.030 --> 33:52.730
came to me himself.

33:52.760 --> 33:54.380
Beneath Changsha, there is a secret place

33:54.550 --> 33:55.530
of immense importance.

33:56.240 --> 33:57.490
My men are trapped there.

33:58.310 --> 34:00.120
Zhang Qishan, who leads the Mystic Nine,

34:00.160 --> 34:01.310
killed all our agents.

34:02.640 --> 34:05.180
I need a Chinese contact above ground.

34:06.310 --> 34:08.050
I'm an American.

34:09.440 --> 34:11.090
Why should I help you?

34:12.880 --> 34:13.860
An American?

34:17.960 --> 34:19.980
The Americans want nothing from China

34:20.480 --> 34:22.130
but its markets and the profits

34:22.230 --> 34:23.090
they can extract.

34:24.280 --> 34:25.340
Stay with them,

34:27.110 --> 34:28.610
and you'll only scrape by,

34:28.710 --> 34:30.090
never able to truly rise in the world.

34:31.030 --> 34:32.690
But the Empire of Japan

34:33.360 --> 34:34.940
wants this land itself.

34:35.400 --> 34:38.460
Sooner or later, it will all be ours.

34:41.510 --> 34:43.010
Help me now,

34:44.000 --> 34:45.650
and one day you'll stand above the rest.

34:46.400 --> 34:47.460
Otherwise,

34:47.800 --> 34:48.980
once the dust settles,

34:49.550 --> 34:52.300
you'll still be a servant begging on your knees.

34:53.070 --> 34:54.050
I'm

34:56.760 --> 34:58.260
not a whole man.

34:59.320 --> 35:00.300
I'd had enough

35:02.880 --> 35:04.010
of being a servant.

35:05.160 --> 35:06.530
To rise above my station,

35:07.710 --> 35:10.300
a foreign passport alone would never

35:11.550 --> 35:12.340
be enough.

35:13.000 --> 35:18.010
I had to become a true master.

35:18.010 --> 35:19.670
[Taihe Pleasure House]

35:19.670 --> 35:21.860
With the help of the Japanese,

35:22.360 --> 35:24.090
I bought Taihe House

35:24.760 --> 35:26.690
to supply Hatoyama with provisions.

35:38.920 --> 35:41.650
There really were people beneath Changsha.

35:42.000 --> 35:43.130
Remarkable.

35:44.400 --> 35:45.650
I later learned

35:46.070 --> 35:47.780
his name was Yoshiyuki Hatoyama.

36:00.840 --> 36:01.690
What else did Hatoyama

36:02.320 --> 36:03.650
tell you about the Otherworld Tower?

36:04.590 --> 36:05.740
He spoke little,

36:07.110 --> 36:08.420
explained nothing,

36:08.800 --> 36:10.420
and only gave orders.

36:12.590 --> 36:14.420
I simply obeyed.

36:14.710 --> 36:15.860
Actually,

36:16.320 --> 36:19.420
you needn't concern yourselves too much with that tower.

36:19.710 --> 36:23.530
It's merely a decoy.

36:24.360 --> 36:26.690
Hatoyama's true destination

36:27.000 --> 36:29.570
is never the Otherworld Tower.

36:31.920 --> 36:33.740
It's the end of the underground river.

36:34.150 --> 36:35.900
You know about the underground river?

36:36.150 --> 36:37.780
How did you find out?

36:37.840 --> 36:39.610
Where does it end? Tell me.

36:41.150 --> 36:42.050
Xiangxi.

36:42.800 --> 36:47.130
I only know it's somewhere in Xiangxi.

36:47.590 --> 36:49.130
Everything they did

36:49.510 --> 36:51.610
was to reach that place.

36:52.000 --> 36:53.010
What's in Xiangxi?

36:53.480 --> 36:55.300
Does it have something to do with the Otherworld Patriarch

36:55.710 --> 36:56.740
or Yin Changsheng?

36:56.960 --> 36:57.940
What is Hatoyama really after?

36:58.400 --> 36:59.860
I don't know.

37:00.630 --> 37:03.420
I just worked all that out myself.

37:05.590 --> 37:06.900
I'm no fool.

37:15.000 --> 37:16.170
What about Unit 401?

37:17.070 --> 37:19.860
Hatoyama arranged that too.

37:20.670 --> 37:22.860
He gave me some pills

37:23.150 --> 37:27.170
that make people obey.

37:28.590 --> 37:29.340
Go on.

37:30.280 --> 37:32.260
I believe it was magic.

37:33.070 --> 37:34.530
And he mastered it,

37:35.550 --> 37:36.570
gaining divine powers

37:37.000 --> 37:39.740
to read fate and glimpse Heaven's secrets.

37:41.630 --> 37:44.090
Perhaps he can hear

37:44.440 --> 37:45.980
this very conversation

37:47.110 --> 37:49.170
right now.

37:57.640 --> 37:58.460
You must know

37:59.720 --> 38:00.860
more than that.

38:01.110 --> 38:04.940
After working with Yoshiyuki Hatoyama all these years,

38:05.560 --> 38:07.100
I discovered long ago

38:07.830 --> 38:10.570
the secret behind the tower's magic.

38:11.150 --> 38:14.220
Yet he always said it wasn't magic

38:14.480 --> 38:15.850
but science.

38:16.120 --> 38:17.690
What nonsense.

38:19.590 --> 38:20.610
How does the magic work?

38:21.110 --> 38:23.780
Tell me, and you may yet redeem yourself.

38:27.510 --> 38:28.940
Zhang Qishan,

38:30.510 --> 38:33.300
you think far too highly of yourself.

38:33.960 --> 38:38.340
Since I know how the magic works,

38:40.960 --> 38:46.170
I can reverse time itself!

39:18.480 --> 39:20.210
I'm leaving.

39:22.110 --> 39:23.690
Zhang Qishan,

39:25.550 --> 39:26.570
farewell.

40:13.710 --> 40:14.490
Come here.

40:16.880 --> 40:17.340
Sir.

40:17.440 --> 40:18.610
We're past the checkpoint.

40:19.510 --> 40:20.650
Now tell me.

40:20.960 --> 40:23.010
Why did you pay to join our caravan?

40:24.880 --> 40:26.980
Well, these are troubled times,

40:27.510 --> 40:28.820
and bandits are everywhere.

40:29.000 --> 40:29.820
Traveling with you

40:30.070 --> 40:30.900
is safer.

40:31.710 --> 40:33.090
You expect me to believe

40:33.510 --> 40:34.740
such nonsense?

40:35.190 --> 40:35.780
Get lost.

40:37.230 --> 40:37.690
Sir,

40:38.710 --> 40:39.210
well...

40:40.760 --> 40:41.780
I'll be honest with you.

40:42.550 --> 40:43.260
You just seemed

40:43.480 --> 40:44.900
like a man I could trust.

40:50.280 --> 40:51.490
Times are hard.

40:52.550 --> 40:53.380
But don't worry.

40:54.110 --> 40:55.570
Since I took your money,

40:56.190 --> 40:57.650
I'll keep your secret.

40:58.480 --> 40:59.570
I know Hankou well.

40:59.670 --> 41:00.380
Once we get there,

41:00.510 --> 41:03.090
I'll find you a few good places to hide.

41:04.030 --> 41:05.570
Thank you, sir. Thank you.

41:06.000 --> 41:06.420
Sir,

41:07.110 --> 41:09.130
may I ask

41:09.510 --> 41:10.130
one more thing?

41:10.670 --> 41:13.260
Have you ever been to Xishan?

41:13.880 --> 41:16.490
I hear there's an old Daoist temple there.

41:18.630 --> 41:19.530
I'd like to take a look.

41:19.710 --> 41:20.530
What a coincidence.

41:21.510 --> 41:22.900
Whenever we transport goods,

41:23.150 --> 41:25.690
we detour through Xishan to hunt for jars.

41:25.880 --> 41:26.780
Hunt for jars?

41:27.230 --> 41:27.690
That's right.

41:27.820 --> 41:28.960
[Good Fortune]

41:28.960 --> 41:31.260
That temple was built by the Otherworld Immortal.

41:31.630 --> 41:33.460
Legend says he could control time.

41:33.880 --> 41:35.420
So his followers devised

41:35.440 --> 41:36.940
a way to store treasures for a century.

41:37.360 --> 41:39.570
They sealed fine wine and tea in ritual jars

41:39.710 --> 41:40.820
and buried them at the temple,

41:40.920 --> 41:43.690
then asked the Patriarch to send them a century into the future.

41:44.230 --> 41:46.610
By the time they were unearthed, the wine would've aged for a century,

41:47.000 --> 41:48.260
and the tea would've become highly prized.

41:48.670 --> 41:50.780
That's why we often try our luck there.

41:52.400 --> 41:54.260
Sadly, most of what we find is worthless.

42:37.630 --> 42:40.690
More visitors. Greetings, gentlemen.

42:51.550 --> 42:53.780
Quite a crowd hunting for jars today.

42:54.550 --> 42:56.820
My friend, this area is ours.

42:57.230 --> 42:58.210
If you want to hunt,

42:58.590 --> 42:59.210
go over there.

43:52.840 --> 43:53.900
What did Zhang Qishan

43:54.510 --> 43:56.010
send you here to investigate?

43:58.510 --> 44:00.170
Why not tell your own fortune

44:01.630 --> 44:03.010
and see how you'll die?

44:08.800 --> 44:09.490
Will you do it or not?

44:11.110 --> 44:12.900
I will!

44:30.880 --> 44:31.490
Well?

44:32.480 --> 44:33.860
How does it say you'll die?

44:35.800 --> 44:36.860
The signs say

44:38.760 --> 44:39.940
I won't die.

44:41.710 --> 44:42.530
Is that so?

44:44.070 --> 44:44.980
What exactly does it say?

44:47.760 --> 44:48.860
"The Master

44:49.960 --> 44:50.940
is compassionate."

45:06.260 --> 45:09.100
♪Surrounded by chaos, I walk through karmic fire♪

45:09.300 --> 45:12.140
♪And swear this city shall never fall♪

45:12.380 --> 45:15.220
♪The code of honor, the realm's survival♪

45:15.500 --> 45:18.180
♪What must I do to live without shame?♪

45:18.180 --> 45:21.380
♪I fear no fate. My word carries the weight of mountains♪

45:21.580 --> 45:24.420
♪I guard this city, with no retreat, regret, or shame♪

45:24.740 --> 45:27.580
♪One cup of wine settles the storm. I rise like a mountain♪

45:27.740 --> 45:30.580
♪The Mystic Nine stand as one and share the same fate♪

45:30.700 --> 45:31.820
♪Hey♪

45:32.460 --> 45:35.500
♪Who dares mock my defiance?♪

45:36.780 --> 45:42.380
♪No need to pretend or play tricks♪

45:42.500 --> 45:45.580
♪In this one life, I'll brave this thorny road♪

45:45.700 --> 45:48.540
♪With my blood aflame, I'll wrest justice back♪

45:48.700 --> 45:51.140
♪I'll fight my way out of this siege♪

45:51.700 --> 45:54.860
♪And tear the darkness apart♪

45:54.860 --> 45:57.740
♪Pour me a drink, however dark the road ahead♪

45:57.900 --> 46:00.780
♪I'll crush the demons buried deep within♪

46:01.020 --> 46:03.980
♪And let the might of our land resound♪

46:04.500 --> 46:10.660
♪Through life and death, I'll stand with you...♪

46:23.320 --> 46:23.780
Stay back.

46:25.280 --> 46:26.460
Master Zhang has been in a foul mood.

46:27.230 --> 46:28.090
Let him work it off.

46:29.100 --> 46:36.460
♪I believe in neither gods, ghosts, nor reincarnation♪

46:36.460 --> 46:39.420
♪In this one life, I'll brave this thorny road♪

46:39.420 --> 46:42.380
♪With my blood aflame, I'll wrest justice back♪

46:42.540 --> 46:44.980
♪I'll fight my way out of this siege♪

46:45.500 --> 46:48.740
♪And tear the darkness apart♪

46:48.740 --> 46:51.660
♪Pour me a drink, however dark the road ahead♪

46:51.660 --> 46:54.660
♪I'll crush the demons buried deep within♪

46:54.900 --> 46:57.940
♪And let the might of our land resound♪

46:58.380 --> 47:04.540
♪Through life and death, I'll stand with you♪

47:16.260 --> 47:19.300
♪At the brink, I'll stand with you, with no way back♪

47:19.540 --> 47:22.380
♪I've never regretted defying fate♪

47:22.540 --> 47:25.220
♪I set out, never asking if I'll return♪

47:25.580 --> 47:28.660
♪Even if defeat carves my name in stone♪

47:28.660 --> 47:31.740
♪In this life, we'll break through once more♪

47:31.740 --> 47:34.620
♪Together we'll defend our land and fight our way through♪

47:34.940 --> 47:38.140
♪Stand with me through it all♪

47:38.340 --> 47:47.180
♪Life or death, I'll fight beside you♪

48:08.480 --> 48:09.300
Master Zhang.

48:19.020 --> 48:21.280
[Redeemable for 500 silver coins, Taihe Pleasure House]

48:21.280 --> 48:21.940
Master Zhang,

48:22.670 --> 48:23.780
they work for Ding Qiansui.

48:24.280 --> 48:24.940
I thought so.

48:31.070 --> 48:31.860
Master Zhang,

48:33.150 --> 48:34.210
it hurts terribly.

48:37.510 --> 48:39.260
Last time, you divined that if I treated you harshly,

48:39.400 --> 48:40.380
you'd escape disaster.

48:40.960 --> 48:41.900
Your prediction was right.

48:43.030 --> 48:44.130
Have you escaped it now?

48:44.230 --> 48:45.460
Perhaps not yet.

49:02.580 --> 49:06.740
♪The past fades like smoke♪

49:07.100 --> 49:09.820
♪A choice is made in silence♪

49:10.100 --> 49:12.900
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

49:13.300 --> 49:17.060
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

49:17.300 --> 49:20.740
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

49:21.020 --> 49:24.420
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

49:24.500 --> 49:31.780
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

49:32.220 --> 49:35.500
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

49:35.780 --> 49:39.020
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

49:39.180 --> 49:43.220
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

49:43.420 --> 49:46.780
♪Who believes in fate?♪

49:47.020 --> 49:50.380
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

49:50.620 --> 49:53.900
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

49:54.220 --> 49:57.900
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

49:58.100 --> 50:01.340
♪Take care♪

50:01.340 --> 50:03.900
♪We once raced♪

50:03.980 --> 50:05.900
♪For the dawn♪

50:06.060 --> 50:09.340
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

50:09.460 --> 50:12.740
♪In the web of fate♪

50:12.740 --> 50:15.940
♪No one can escape♪

50:16.940 --> 50:18.780
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

50:18.940 --> 50:20.500
♪We too were young once♪

50:20.580 --> 50:24.020
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

50:24.220 --> 50:26.540
♪Keep the ember lit♪

50:26.660 --> 50:31.180
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

50:31.300 --> 50:34.260
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

50:34.500 --> 50:38.020
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

50:38.140 --> 50:41.900
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

50:42.220 --> 50:45.700
♪Who believes in fate?♪

50:45.860 --> 50:48.860
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

50:49.100 --> 50:52.860
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

50:53.020 --> 50:56.740
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

50:56.860 --> 51:08.300
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
